        "created_at": "2014-08-09T15:21:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was a good Pennsic - although it seemed there were more holds in the rapier melees than the heavies. I heard of shield bashes and slap shots being thrown in light weapons. Weather was slightly wet, but nicely cool. Yurt performed well.<br><br>Gulf wars would be a serious drive for my kids to handle.</p>",
