        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-14T03:09:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I played Chinese Chess (<span>Xiangqi), and the Game of the Goose (4 year old enjoys it). I played</span> 3 games of Go. I sometimes help Lord Xavier with his class as an extra teacher when the people pair off.<br><br>I spent more time in classes - Baba Yaga, Knots, Scotch Appreciation, etc. - than any one thing. I also spent a large amount of time at Thrown Weapons with the nine year old. I'm currently making Atlatls out of paint sticks.<br><br>My camp&nbsp; did an Owain Phyfe appreciation this year in lieu of our regular Hafla. While a deliberately more intimate party, it was really nice.</p>",
